      "claim": "Mean absolute oral bioavailability of desipramine was 38% after a 50 mg oral dose in healthy volunteers, above the 20% threshold.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C14"],
      "claim": "Absolute oral bioavailability of DFMO in humans was 58% versus IV, above the 20% threshold.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
